                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I testified at the Rules Committee to submit an amendment saying what we\u2019re all thinking: nobody wants this Big Ugly Republican Bill.\n\nMillions of people will be kicked off their health insurance and lose their nutrition assistance. This bill is bad for America, our health, and our future.",
