                "text": "This week, I visited Emanate Health in West Covina to tour the hospital and new expansion projects. We discussed their concerns around Medicaid funding cuts and the detrimental impacts of cutting these critical health services. Medicaid is a lifeline for Californians and I will continue to fight to protect affordable, accessible healthcare.",
