                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "These layoffs will have ripple effects down to the state and local levels. \n\nTrump has already froze education funds, put Pell Grants in jeopardy, and hurt medical student loans. \n\nCan we just say it: Trump\u2019s goal is to kill education and make the country stupid.",
