                "text": "The Trump Administration is devastating Los Angeles County\u2019s entire health system and causing pure chaos.\nHospitals and clinics are anticipating mass layoffs, grant funding for combatting the spread of infectious diseases has been slashed, and the county has had to cut its bioterrorism watch program.\n\nhttps://t.co/wBbS5Xhc33",
