                "text": "Today is Honor Our Veterans Day of Action, a reminder of our responsibility to those who\u2019ve sacrificed so much for our country. I am committed to continuing to fight for our veterans every day, whether that\u2019s expanding access to mental health resources, securing critical funding for our servicemembers and their families, or helping our veterans across CA-31 navigate the VA.",
