                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The tax credits that help working families afford healthcare are set to expire while Republican leadership turns a blind eye. Today, I toured the Kaiser Permanente Bernard J. Tyson School of Medicine to speak with staff and see the incredible medical and educational facilities that are at risk of funding cuts that will impact their students, patients, and critical care services around our community.",
