                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Democrats are not going to rubber stamp a bill that slashes healthcare and forces families to decide between groceries or medicine. That\u2019s not a \u201cclean CR,\u201d that\u2019s a scam. \n\nCome back to DC and negotiate.",
